<span id="A1.T5.2.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:241.9pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Relies on metaphors, idioms, or cultural references including pop culture or region-specific expressions</span>
</span></td></tr>
